# The Vercel project's Root Directory is `ccd-website`, but a CLI deploy run from
# the repo root still uploads everything here first. Without this it tries to
# read the 61GB media archives — which are OneDrive-synced and often locked, so
# the deploy fails with EBUSY.
#
# Keep this in step with .gitignore.

Cooperative Community Development Inc/
website-media-filebase/
Shoe Drive CCD/
building-the-block-prototype/project/media/

# Not needed to build the site
assets/
docs/
wix-migration-kit/
scripts/
.agent-orchestration/
node_modules
.git
